  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch calls remaining grotto-heaven forces to reinforce against Heavenly Court in immemorial black heaven, Strange Hair grotto-heaven brings an incomplete Immortal Gu House, Black Emperor Building. Narration groups it with Chaotic Rock grotto-heaven and Rotten Egg grotto-heaven as one of the three forces close to Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch that commit trump cards rather than token strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1994
