    },
    {
      "text": "In the fight inside Ice Crystal grotto-heaven, Demon Judgment Board’s killer moves leave the incomplete Black Emperor Building waiting at the back, not daring to contest the Immortal Gu House directly.",
      "chapters": [
        1994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
