    },
    {
      "text": "Strange Hair Grotto Lord is covered in black hair. During Fang Yuan’s assault on Fire Plain grotto-heaven he activates Black Emperor Building, rampages across the field, and has already killed one Gu Immortal from Fire Plain grotto-heaven. Narration states that Golden Hair grotto-heaven and Strange Hair grotto-heaven have been annexed by Fang Yuan and become part of the sovereign immortal aperture.",
